#. translators: Doc block reference, not translated.
#. The text domain "godevs-portfolio" is used throughout the theme.

#. Notes for translators
#. --------------------
#. GoDevs Portfolio is a block theme. The vast majority of user-facing
#. strings live inside block markup (templates in /templates/, template
#. parts in /parts/, and patterns in /patterns/) where they are treated
#. as content rather than code. Translators edit these strings directly
#. in the Site Editor and save their translations per-site.
#.
#. The strings extractable via this .pot file are the PHP-side strings
#. in functions.php (currently, only the doc-comment strings above and
#. the theme metadata). When GoDevs Core ships (Phase 8) it will register
#. additional translatable strings for CPT labels and admin notices; those
#. will live in the plugin's own text domain, not the theme's.
#.
#. For per-site translation of pattern content, use the Site Editor. For
#. full locale translation of any future PHP strings, regenerate this
#. .pot file via:
#.
#.     wp i18n make-pot . languages/godevs-portfolio.pot \
#.         --domain=godevs-portfolio \
#.         --exclude=node_modules,tests,docs
